stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Built : CI passed on main
  Built --> Published : image pushed to GHCR
  Published --> StagingDeploying : deploy-staging starts
  StagingDeploying --> StagingLive : health check OK
  StagingDeploying --> StagingRolledBack : health check failed
  StagingRolledBack --> [*]
  StagingLive --> AwaitingApproval : production job queued
  AwaitingApproval --> ProductionDeploying : reviewer approves
  AwaitingApproval --> Rejected : reviewer rejects or timeout
  ProductionDeploying --> Live : health check OK
  ProductionDeploying --> ProductionRolledBack : health check failed
  Live --> Superseded : newer release goes live
  ProductionRolledBack --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  Superseded --> [*]
